{
  "id": "ISA.36",
  "number": "36",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 36",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now it came to pass in the fourteenth year of king Hezekiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sennacherib king of Assyria came up against all the defenced cities of Judah, and took them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king of Assyria sent Rabshakeh from Lachish to Jerusalem unto king Hezekiah with a great army. And he stood by the conduit of the upper pool in the highway of the fuller's field.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then came forth unto him Eliakim, Hilkiah's son, which was over the house, and Shebna the scribe, and Joah, Asaph's son, the recorder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And Rabshakeh said unto them, Say ye now to Hezekiah, Thus saith the great king, the king of Assyria, What confidence",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this wherein thou trustest?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "sayest thou",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", (but",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they are but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vain words)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I have",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "counsel and strength for war: now on whom dost thou trust, that thou rebellest against me?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, thou trustest in the staff of this broken reed, on Egypt; whereon if a man lean, it will go into his hand, and pierce it: so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pharaoh king of Egypt to all that trust in him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if thou say to me, We trust in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not he, whose high places and whose altars Hezekiah hath taken away, and said to Judah and to Jerusalem, Ye shall worship before this altar?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore give pledges, I pray thee, to my master the king of Assyria, and I will give thee two thousand horses, if thou be able on thy part to set riders upon them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How then wilt thou turn away the face of one captain of the least of my master's servants, and put thy trust on Egypt for chariots and for horsemen?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And am I now come up without the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against this land to destroy it? the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto me, Go up against this land, and destroy it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then said Eliakim and Shebna and Joah unto Rabshakeh, Speak, I pray thee, unto thy servants in the Syrian language; for we understand",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and speak not to us in the Jews' language, in the ears of the people that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on the wall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ But Rabshakeh said, Hath my master sent me to thy master and to thee to speak these words?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "hath he",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "sent me",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the men that sit upon the wall, that they may eat their own dung, and drink their own piss with you?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Rabshakeh stood, and cried with a loud voice in the Jews' language, and said, Hear ye the words of the great king, the king of Assyria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the king, Let not Hezekiah deceive you: for he shall not be able to deliver you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither let Hezekiah make you trust in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", saying, The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will surely deliver us: this city shall not be delivered into the hand of the king of Assyria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearken not to Hezekiah: for thus saith the king of Assyria, Make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "an agreement",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "by",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.36.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a present, and come out to me: and eat ye every one of his vine, and every one of his fig tree, and drink ye every one the waters of his own cistern;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Until I come and take you away to a land like your own land, a land of corn and wine, a land of bread and vineyards.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
